<title>DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF CONGO: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF THE CONGO GOVERNMENT LIST (970709)</p>
<p>(Formerly ZAIRE)</p>
<p> Head of State (From 17 May 97)..........Laurent KABILA (AFDL)</p>
<p>(Also Defence Minister)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Apptd 22 May 97 &amp; 6 June &amp; 12 June 97)</p>
<p>MINISTERS</p>
<p> Agriculture...............................Paul BANDOMA (UDPS)</p>
<p> Civil Service........................Justine KASA-VUBU (UDPS)</p>
<p> Defence.....................................See Head of State</p>
<p> Economy, Industry &amp; Trade..........Pierre Victor MPOYO (AFDL)</p>
<p> Education............................KAMARA Waka Ikara (AFDL)</p>
<p> Energy...........................LOKOMBE Kitete Pierre (AFDL)</p>
<p> Environment...............................Eddie ANGULU (AFDL)</p>
<p> Finance.........................MAWAMPANGA Mwana Nanga (AFDL)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs..........................Bizima KARAHA (AFDL)</p>
<p> Health.................Jean-Baptiste SONDJI (Patriotic Front)</p>
<p> Information &amp; Cultural Affairs..........Raphael GHENDA (AFDL)</p>
<p> Internal Affairs........................MWENZE Kongolo (AFDL)</p>
<p> International Cooperation............Thomas KANZA (Lumumbist)</p>
<p> Justice................................Celestin LWANGY (AFDL)</p>
<p> Mines.................................MATUTULO Kambale (AFDL)</p>
<p> National Reconstruction..........Etienne Richard MBAYA (AFDL)</p>
<p> Planning &amp; Development......................BABI Mbayi (AFDL)</p>
<p> Posts &amp; Telecommunications.............KINKELA Vi Kan'si (PF)</p>
<p> Public Works.....................BISHIKWABO Tshiumbaka (AFDL)</p>
<p> Transport...................................MOVA Henri (AFDL)</p>
<p> Youth &amp; Sports.................Vincent MUTOMBO Tshibal (AFDL)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>DEPUTY MINISTERS</p>
<p> Information.......................Juliana LUMUMBA (Lumumbist)</p>
<p> Social Affairs.........................MILULU Mamboleo (AFDL)</p>
<p> Interior................................Faustin MUNENE (AFDL)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p> AFDL - Alliance of Democratic Forces for the Liberation</p>
<p>	  of Congo.</p>
<p> UDPS - Union for Democracy and Social Progress.</p>
<p> PF   - Patriotic Front.</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
